          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p>A 15-foot radius of magical darkness extends out from the darkmantle, moves with it, and spreads around corners. The darkness lasts as long as the darkmantle maintains @status[concentration], up to 10 minutes (as if @status[concentration||concentrating] on a spell). Darkvision can't penetrate this darkness, and no natural light can illuminate it. If any of the darkness overlaps with an area of light created by a spell of 2nd level or lower, the spell creating the light is dispelled.</p></div>",
